---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | kitcheck.cc"
  description="Privacy policy for kitcheck.cc. Learn what data we collect, why, and how it is used."
  canonical="https://kitcheck.cc/privacy"
>
  <SiteHeader>
    <a href="/" class="btn-primary">Use the calculator</a>
  </SiteHeader>

  <section class="bg-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-2xl pt-16 md:pt-18 lg:pt-20 pb-12 md:pb-14">
        <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-text-light mb-5">
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-text-mid transition-colors">kitcheck.cc</a>
          <span>›</span>
          <span class="text-text-mid">Privacy policy</span>
        </nav>
        <h1 class="font-head text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] text-text mb-4">
          Privacy policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-text-mid leading-relaxed">
          Last updated: April 2026
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-bg border-t border-border">
    <div class="container py-14 md:py-18">
      <div class="max-w-2xl prose-custom">

        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          kitcheck.cc is a free cycling kit calculator, operated by Ties Kuiper. Questions
          about this policy can be sent to
          <a href="mailto:privacy@kitcheck.cc">privacy@kitcheck.cc</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>What data we collect</h2>
        <p>
          We do not ask you to create an account, fill in a form, or provide any personal
          information directly. The only data collected is anonymous analytics data, and
          only if you give your consent.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you accept analytics cookies, Google Analytics 4 (GA4) records:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Pages you visit and how long you spend on them</li>
          <li>The city or region you are in (derived from your IP address; the full IP address is not stored)</li>
          <li>The device type, browser, and operating system you use</li>
          <li>How you arrived at the site (e.g. a search engine or direct link)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          None of this is linked to your name, email address, or any other identifier.
          If you decline analytics cookies, nothing is collected.
        </p>

        <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
        <p>
          Analytics help us understand how the calculator is used so we can improve it.
          For example, knowing which locations are searched most often helps us prioritise
          weather data accuracy.
        </p>

        <h2>Legal basis</h2>
        <p>
          We process analytics data on the basis of your consent (GDPR Article 6(1)(a)).
          Analytics are disabled by default and only activated after you click Accept in
          the cookie banner. You can withdraw consent at any time by clearing your browser
          storage for kitcheck.cc.
        </p>

        <h2>Who we share data with</h2>
        <p>
          Analytics data is processed by Google LLC under the Google Analytics service.
          Google may store data on servers outside the EEA; this transfer is covered by
          Google's standard contractual clauses.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not sell data, share it with advertisers, or use it for any purpose other
          than understanding site usage.
        </p>

        <h2>Weather data</h2>
        <p>
          When you search for a location, the location name and coordinates are sent to
          <a href="https://open-meteo.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open-Meteo</a>
          to fetch a weather forecast. Open-Meteo is a free, open-source weather API.
          We do not store the locations you search for.
        </p>

        <h2>How long data is kept</h2>
        <p>
          Google Analytics retains aggregated data for 14 months by default. Your consent
          preference is stored in your browser's local storage until you clear it.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          Under GDPR you have the right to access, correct, or erase personal data we hold
          about you, and the right to object to or restrict processing. Because we do not
          collect identifiable personal data, most of these rights are not practically
          applicable, but you are welcome to contact us if you have questions.
        </p>
        <p>
          You also have the right to lodge a complaint with your national data protection
          authority.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          For a full list of cookies set by this site, see our
          <a href="/cookies">Cookie policy</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          If we make material changes to how we handle data, we will update this page and
          revise the date at the top.
        </p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SiteFooter />
</Base>

<style>
  .prose-custom h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-head, inherit);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .prose-custom p,
  .prose-custom ul {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text-mid);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .prose-custom ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    list-style: disc;
  }
  .prose-custom li {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .prose-custom a {
    color: var(--color-coral);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .prose-custom a:hover {
    opacity: 0.75;
  }
</style>
